# INBOX-172 — unsigned quotient production wiring

Status: production wiring and correctness gates complete. The required
counterbalanced performance run is pending the follow-up immutable evidence
commit. UQ32 and UQ64 are wired together through `ValueUseTransaction`; the
`urem` dispatch and `lowerUnsignedRem` remainder path are unchanged.

No Tier 3 command was run.

